            "review_title": "Review at Vi Bac CAFE & CUISINE",
            "review_text": "epicurien972\nLes Sables-d'Olonne, France512 contributions\n0\nAs pretty as it is good!\nAug 2026 • Couples\nVery convenient because it's next to the train station and because they start serving from 5 p.m.! The decor is very polished and the dishes are as well, and they are truly delicious and original! We especially ate a lotus sprout salad and noodles with crab and clams: a treat! The staff is very attentive and charming! They were preparing birthday decorations that took them over an hour and a magnificent cake!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 11, 2026",
